			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman defined by the provided three-view reference sheet (image 1): lock her facial proportions, long black half-up hair with the silver hair crown set with a blue gemstone, silver hairpins with pearl tassels, pearl drop earrings, red floral forehead mark, and layered deep-blue to pale-blue hanfu with silver embroidery and silver arm guards. The sheet serves only as character identity reference; its multi-panel layout, borders and labels must not appear in the video.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 5-second vertical 9:16 live-action realistic chest-up close-up of <Subject 1> seated on a sunny park bench, reaching her hand out as if touching the sunlight while speaking one contented line, with her identity taken from the three-view reference.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved\n\ndetailed_description:\nLive-action realistic photography, vertical 9:16, 5.00 seconds total, bright clear daytime sunlight, clean full-frame footage. [Shot 1] Chest-up close-up, centered composition, shallow depth of field. <Subject 1> appears as a photorealistic young woman seated on a wooden park bench, reinterpreted in live-action style while keeping all identity anchors: long black hair in a half-updo with the silver hair crown and blue gem, silver hairpins with pearl tassels, pearl drop earrings, red floral forehead mark, and the layered deep-blue inner robe and pale-blue outer robe with silver embroidered collar visible across her chest and shoulders; the top edge of the wooden bench backrest shows behind her. Background: sunlit park with green foliage and warm bokeh under a clear sky, strong warm sunlight streaming from the upper front right, gentle rim light on her hair and a soft lens flare near her raised hand. Static shot with a very slow push-in of small amplitude. At 0.00 seconds she faces slightly toward the light with a soft serene smile; at 0.40 seconds she slowly raises her right hand toward the sunlight, fingers relaxed and spread, palm half-turned upward as if touching the light; at 1.00 seconds the light glows between her fingers with a small warm flare. Her lips begin moving at 1.20 seconds, gaze drifting gently between the lens and her raised hand. <Subject 1> (S1), a young woman's voice, gentle and bright with contented warmth, medium-slow pace, says: <d>[Chinese] 4步加速真好啊!</d> While speaking, her raised hand drifts slightly and the fingers curl softly as if catching the sunlight, eyes narrowing with quiet pleasure. At 3.90 seconds the line ends and her lips close into a contented smile; she gives one small satisfied exhale, head tilting a little upward toward the light, hand still raised with relaxed fingers, holding the pose steadily until 5.00 seconds.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA bright outdoor park ambience with a gentle breeze through leaves, soft distant birdsong, faint cloth rustle as <Subject 1> raises her arm, and one small contented exhale right after her spoken line. No other voices.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
